    {
      "post_id": "2083646993092497622",
      "url": "https://x.com/EcomShri/status/2083646993092497622",
      "text": "You think the quality of your products is the reason your brand can't scale consistently\n\nMeanwhile, we have Temu out here beating the biggest brands - brands like Gymshark\n\nHere's the reality with Google ads:\n\nHaving great products is a necessity, but Google's algorithm doesn't know the quality of your products\n\nIt understands the quality of your product feed and the perceived value\n\nThe only way to feed this algorithm the right data is by increasing the perceived value\n\nWe do this by focusing on the end goals of:\n\n- Getting users to spend more time on our landing pages\n- Having a higher than normal CTR \n\nJust two things\n\nGetting these on point takes care of everything else",
      "original_text": "You think the quality of your products is the reason your brand can't scale consistently\n\nMeanwhile, we have Temu out here beating the biggest brands - brands like Gymshark\n\nHere's the reality with Google ads:\n\nHaving great products is a necessity, but Google's algorithm doesn't know the quality of your products\n\nIt understands the quality of your product feed and the perceived value\n\nThe only way to feed this algorithm the right data is by increasing the perceived value\n\nWe do this by focusing on the end goals of:\n\n- Getting users to spend more time on our landing pages\n- Having a higher than normal CTR \n\nJust two things\n\nGetting these on point takes care of everything else",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "你以为你的产品质量是你的品牌无法持续扩大的原因\n\n与此同时，我们看到 Temu 在这里击败最大的品牌——像 Gymshark 这样的品牌\n\n这就是 Google 广告的现实：\n\n拥有优秀的产品是必要条件，但 Google 的算法并不知道你的产品质量\n\n它理解的是你的产品 Feed 的质量和感知价值\n\n向这个算法提供正确数据的唯一方法，就是提高感知价值\n\n我们通过专注于以下最终目标来做到这一点：\n\n- 让用户在我们的落地页上停留更长时间\n- 拥有高于正常水平的 CTR\n\n就这两件事\n\n把这两点做到位，其他一切都会迎刃而解",
      "translation_status": "translated",
